ps://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619836_1237132168326387_2183731442049155847_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oqX17t_F8AwQ7kNvwE9Q4hY&_nc_oc=AdoHr3QQBAr5MvT-8CfYGkmHCozZBQ8JFhKmSSRrxZiUUZearpP6Bo8QRBX4k8EKvnw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9O8lzRa6_aa198SPdCYeJCPffmDBt_FOWBr-4VqfopIg&oe=6A2C028F"}, {"file_name": "Cover Landscape_FULL_ENG.png", "id": "884644501207363", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823893_884644504540696_1379382285860789409_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WI_QniJiOkAQ7kNvwGUgjT5&_nc_oc=AdpUAnYAx2h6vsM-dqCQIwDY9ErRuubZUx3acZXrrdYLMwYVlyQ1uKNBHMdWqvyKaJQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_0wC5rXV0q8_Bme5lm0jQBfPAYzdDwltTDGs0hoabZoA&oe=6A2C277E"}]}, "id": "2481659452294539", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "ecocardio-Screenshot-001.png", "id": "1204174037792977", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400248_1204174041126310_5851841347649338254_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=em4xm9ldPwEQ7kNvwEnDtju&_nc_oc=AdqOAFUELhy20SuWTKilvw8llpoOZY2L23l1fsfs1Lx6EbOgctbdgeQJTQCCUATx70w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9Q9VLdRkhfRp8pugOtY-mTD0fTCq_7-s0dDTAGMs3R2Q&oe=6A2C0961"}, {"file_name": "ecocardio-Screenshot-002.png", "id": "1683364999261437", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391911_1683365002594770_6182534077774161018_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uD3xPf469e8Q7kNvwHHCI3_&_nc_oc=Adp3ex2BCMmZ66_mqkIwXZE6DGAgSRDJb_H21tTHG_rRTpq935LJdVojJ_tC6ZhSyAs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-sNXKF3OpbhyDbwHKxHvFP4QiGj2vicleiAUAhREH7NA&oe=6A2C0BBF"}, {"file_name": "ecocardio-Screenshot-004.png", "id": "645259521197957", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391893_645259524531290_1221040782683536363_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CU3H6y5itIMQ7kNvwE4EH5z&_nc_oc=AdqGNRsAr0NAJn9rFjln4TV4hYXLOb-bvoQfGwjmPZpsHUYaef2zd9IWa-tr-hE8YpQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-_0SlS4auz9Vwk5npfacLaEymVjKyNPFtQnyKHMy6WnA&oe=6A2C264E"}, {"file_name": "ecocardio-Screenshot-003.png", "id": "663923902976794", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393984_663923906310127_5574735863383485136_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=munX2Iz1fVMQ7kNvwGBVzcC&_nc_oc=AdrTZjqVWY2zgrBxbws3DeFWT1KW2S_8KzqL7NLtcjICq8MU79Zxxjh3Wx7CtBKzhe8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_PTZGmdAE0np3bHyWnOr_nRZhrnWSVMNOz1zxXZA1EHg&oe=6A2C2ED9"}, {"file_name": "ecocardio-Screenshot-005.png", "id": "590596830460245", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391890_590596833793578_6307124770371399137_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vMlf1zu4qAcQ7kNvwH1ir5r&_nc_oc=AdokQHfUs30B0s_qkLJ7XgTExdTan_3kqR9xXgkZ5KFOHn093gcPHNkOAYKTpWmXd9Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af94VJwGotztxHbHBxm2Hwcn30BctDMkV2J0AXUyIRgF3A&oe=6A2C10CB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Echocardiography VR - VML", "keywords": ["Echography", "POCUS", "Medical", "Ultrasound", "Healthcare"], "long_description": "**Echocardiography VR**, by VML, is a virtual reality simulation that transforms how medical students and healthcare professionals learn cardiac ultrasound.\n\nStep into a simulation room where you'll master transducer positioning, orientation, and anatomical recognition through hands-on practice. Place the probe on your virtual patient, adjust it to find the correct windows, and activate **X-ray mode** to see how your transducer intersects the heart in real-time.\n\nThe machine offers three learning modes:\n- **2D Mode**: real echocardiography footage as you scan\n- **Freeze Mode**: anatomical illustrations where you identify each structure\n- **3D Mode**: slice through an interactive heart with a special probe and switch to ultrasound-style materials\n\n**Egbot**, your android guide, walks you through a complete tutorial to get the most out of each mode.\n\nWhether you're a student or healthcare professional, this simulation gives you a safe environment to build confidence before scanning real patients!", "short_description": "Improve your echocardiography skills with this immersive VR simulation! Step into the operating room to scan your virtual patient. Learn to identify different cardiac structures through interactive visualizations: see through the chest as if using X-rays, dissect a 3D heart to understand each structure, and more. All guided by Egbot, your virtual tutor."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover Landscape_FULL_ES.png", "id": "2558894087837590", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822968_2558894094504256_5404181423913633795_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yU9X6pn5FS8Q7kNvwGpBmKl&_nc_oc=Adqu7jXV2jaUv2DAHcneykfOEBjsdnj0CO3biUqSXH58k4BgrvRuwq8jJkEIXaKxUCk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9wBOzWPnL25rvLpLv3gYUXwV_ERG8ASulD0yz3Pr13Nw&oe=6A2C0C6E"}, {"file_name": "Cover Landscape_FULL_ES.png", "id": "1971181917156082", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830888_1971181920489415_1647681755962022117_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HcsNZp-IVTwQ7kNvwGS_5qe&_nc_oc=AdoVvWfUkBrCWN4PMx3QhYhkYnfw7jA0SedWpucW9Ugt_lYJnMmSYNTdSk6SwknHyaA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_sf79DP50l6zmNLTTUvS4YXExgYAWl7JY4KYZlErp1ag&oe=6A2C02E9"}, {"file_name": "Cover Square_FULL_ES-1.png", "id": "1912394656053179", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823893_1912394659386512_7066665920184004452_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HJyJrdtnIUAQ7kNvwEhxPPR&_nc_oc=Ado_xLgln4G8GuRdsSGreoj3EMjqUOejJ6vHC_V5mw-OLy8bW4jYApIXhd2NY8syuYU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_js4H7NIeHgqaU_zNCBhVM3JtGJTieYnLFWX06FL_KQw&oe=6A2C13CC"}, {"file_name": "Cover Portrait_FULL_ES.png", "id": "1822870681733204", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827703_1822870685066537_4560401566713579284_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HvNLAGtNrHkQ7kNvwFTB_KS&_nc_oc=AdoNVQ1EKTQqRJpxuy0txsN9eraMlmPoo5T86WH1x3Z4CF_ZIVpxNnHr7j80WvAfbC0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8oGXsrm-c8AB_Ui4hQacY9_etqELdyUskVGwb2PCslxg&oe=6A2C1B2C"}, {"file_name": "ECHO-DEMO-SQUARE-3.png", "id": "1465068948371145", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827725_1465068951704478_8306382549700619272_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AqNJpoPzxuEQ7kNvwG1ZQRG&_nc_oc=AdoSN6IQUuT1PY4lWS5YDt_B7XfqOqj2-EKhY3xkYR_Ef74m1-7LStTpVlHpzUp8Ajo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9S3_HlaY4aor3woXYhkarDT8pkb6uLrAY2WLVJm7TGXQ&oe=6A2C0C46"}]}, "id": "1234561742089673", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ecocardiograf\u00eda VR - VML", "keywords": ["Medicina", "Ultrasonido", "POCUS", "Ecografia", "Salud"], "long_description": "**Ecocardiograf\u00eda VR**, de VML, es una simulaci\u00f3n de realidad virtual que transforma c\u00f3mo estudiantes de medicina y profesionales de la salud aprenden ultrasonido card\u00edaco.\n\nEntra a una sala de simulaci\u00f3n donde dominar\u00e1s el posicionamiento del transductor, su orientaci\u00f3n y el reconocimiento anat\u00f3mico mediante pr\u00e1ctica activa. Coloca la sonda en tu paciente virtual, aj\u00fastala para encontrar las ventanas correctas, y activa el **modo rayos X** para ver c\u00f3mo tu transductor intersecta el coraz\u00f3n en tiempo real.\n\nLa m\u00e1quina ofrece tres modos de aprendizaje:\n- **Modo 2D**: videos reales de ecocardiograf\u00eda mientras escaneas\n- **Modo Congelado**: ilustraciones anat\u00f3micas donde identificas cada estructura\n- **Modo 3D**: corta un coraz\u00f3n interactivo con una sonda especial y cambia a materiales estilo ultrasonido\n\n**Egbot**, tu gu\u00eda androide, te acompa\u00f1a con un tutorial completo para aprovechar cada modo.\n\nYa seas estudiante o profesional de la salud, esta simulaci\u00f3n te da un ambiente seguro para ganar confianza antes de escanear pacientes reales.", "short_description": "Mejora tus habilidades de ecocardiograf\u00eda con esta simulaci\u00f3n inmersiva en VR. Ad\u00e9ntrate al quir\u00f3fano para escanear a tu paciente virtual con videos reales de ultrasonido, y aprende a identificar las estructuras card\u00edacas mediante visualizaciones interactivas: ve a trav\u00e9s del t\u00f3rax como si usaras rayos X, disecciona un coraz\u00f3n 3D, y m\u00e1s. Todo esto guiado por Egbot, tu tutor virtual."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vml.solutions/privacy-echocardiography-vr-vml", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Virtual Medical Learning", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vml.solutions/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "478089301798119"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["es_MX", "en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "suppor